  "bodyHash": "cbcfd9d2bb59733f",
  "content": "\n\n<h1>EMF 兼容：沉浸旋律</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/XLUpeCri/images/78a59aa9b67148fdd8a1da72ba2c0ae9610ba0b7.gif\" alt=\"跳跃与演奏！\"></p>\n<p>一款轻量级客户端模组，用于让<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-melodies\" rel=\"nofollow\">沉浸旋律</a></strong>的乐器动画与<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" rel=\"nofollow\">实体模型特性</a></strong>的玩家模型正确协同工作。</p>\n<p>已在<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fa-player-extension\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Animations：玩家扩展包</a></strong>上完成测试，但应适用于所有玩家动画资源包。</p>\n<h2>功能</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>兼容<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fa-player-extension\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Animations：玩家扩展包</a></strong>。</li>\n<li>演奏乐器时，其动作不会被资源包动画覆盖。</li>\n<li>应能兼容大多数基于 EMF 的玩家动画资源包。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>祝你游玩愉快 <sup>_</sup></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
